# Copy to `.dev.vars` (git-ignored) for local overrides with `wrangler dev`.
#
# The CaféDesk Online Worker needs NO secrets today: host and device
# credentials are random per restaurant and only their SHA-256 hashes live in
# D1; staff sessions are verified with each restaurant's public Ed25519 key.
# Never put Cloudflare API tokens or account credentials here.
#
# Optional overrides of the non-secret limits in wrangler.jsonc "vars":
# MAX_BACKUP_BYTES=52428800
# MAX_MEDIA_BYTES=5242880
#
# If a secret is ever added, use a placeholder here, the real value only in
# your local .dev.vars, and `wrangler secret put NAME` for a deployment (which
# needs the owner's explicit instruction):
# EXAMPLE_SECRET=replace-me-locally
